:: dontay [b5 trainer]
<p>A serious-looking Mergimal trainer is standing on the beach. They have a fishing rod.</p>
<p>"Woah! I almost had that one. It would have been an easy catch if you didn't scare it off the hook. Oh, well.</p>
<p>My name is Dontay, and this is my favorite fishing spot."</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Ask them how the fish are biting.->dontay: biting]]</li>
  <li>[[Challenge them to a contest.->dontay: contest]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave them alone for now and continue exploring.->b5]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: biting [b5 trainer contest]
<p>"Oh, I'm catching all sorts of fish! That's why they call it 'catching' not 'fishing'!</p>
<p>Dontay holds their hands out to measure the air. "The last one was this big."</p>
<p>They pull their hands even further apart. "No wait, THIS big!"</p>
<p>The hands move another six inches apart. "Ok, fine, this big."</p>
<p>They beam with pride, looking at you for a reaction.</p>
[[Erm...cool story.->dontay: met]]

:: dontay: met
<p>Dontay gives you a grin and casts their line into the water.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Challenge them to a contest.->dontay: contest]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave them alone for now and continue exploring.->b5]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: contest [b5 trainer contest]
<<set $dontaySkips = random(2, 10)>>
<<set $dontayDistance = random(2, 10)>>
<<set $dontayResult = $dontaySkips * $dontayDistance>>
<p>"Well, if you insist.... Do you like skipping rocks?"</p>
<p>He continues without waiting for a response, "Personally, I love it. Step back and watch this."</p>
<p>Dontay pulls a flat, triangular stone from their pocket and chucks it into the waves.</p>
<p>The rock skips $dontaySkips times.</p>
<p>Each skip was about $dontayDistance inches.</p>
<p>"See that? That was like a million inches!" Dontay hands you a stone. "Think you skip farther than me?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[['Take your turn.'->'dontay: skipping contest player turn']]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: skipping contest player turn [b5 trainer contest]
<<set $playerSkips = random(2, 10)>>
<<set $playerDistance = random(2, 10)>>
<<set $playerResult = $playerSkips * $playerDistance>>
<<set $contestDifference = 0>>
<<script>>
  State.variables.contestDifference = Math.abs(State.variables.playerResult - State.variables.dontayResult);
<</script>>
<p>You crouch into your best skipping pose and let one rip.</p>
<p>The rock skips $playerSkips times.</p>
<p>Each skip was about $playerDistance inches.</p>
<p>"Not bad," Dontay says. "But I totally won, right?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[You sure did.->dontay: lost]]</li>
  <li>[[Huh? No way. I won!->dontay: won]]</li>
	<li>[[Actually, it was a tie.->dontay: tie]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: lost [b5 trainer contest]
<<if $playerResult > $dontayResult>>
<p>"Wait, did you not count my skips? I was joking. You actually won.... But I'll give you another shot."</p>
<<elseif $playerResult < $dontayResult>>
<p>"Sure, you lost, but I'll give you a chance to feel good about yourself."</p>
<<else>>
<p>"Huh? I was kidding! We actually tied. What a coincidence, huh? But here's the real challenge..."</p>
<</if>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Take on the challenge.->dontay: challenge]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave and come back another time.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: won [b5 trainer contest]
<<if $playerResult > $dontayResult>>
<p>"Ok, fine. I was just kidding.... You did win. But I have another challenge for you."</p>
<<elseif $playerResult < $dontayResult>>
<p>"Did you not count my skips? My skip distance was way higher so I won.... But I'll give you another shot."</p>
<<else>>
<p>"Huh? I was kidding! We actually tied. What a coincidence, huh? But here's the real challenge..."</p>
<</if>>

:: dontay: tie [b5 trainer contest]
<<if $playerResult > $dontayResult>>
<p>"Wait, did you not count my skips? I was joking. You actually won.... But I'll give you another shot."</p>
<<elseif $playerResult < $dontayResult>>
<p>"Did you not count my skips? My skip distance was way higher so I won.... But I'll give you another shot."</p>
<<else>>
<p>"Ah, my mistake. You're right, we tied with $playerResult each. What a coincidence, huh? Now here's the real challenge..."
<</if>>

:: dontay: challenge
<p>Dontay looks at you with a serious look: "What was the difference between the distance of our skips?"</p>
<p><<numberbox '$playerAnswer' 0 autofocus>></p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Give your answer.'>>
      <<if $playerAnswer == $contestDifference>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest success'>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest error'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Can you give me a hint?->dontay: hint]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave and come back another time.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: hint [b4 trainer contest]
<p>"Well, you skipped $playerSkips times and each skip went $playerDistance inches, right?"</p>
<p>"So just multiply $playerSkips by $playerDistance."</p>
<p>"And then multiply $dontaySkips by $dontayDistance"</p>
<p>"And then subtract one from the other!"</p>
<p><<numberbox '$playerAnswer' 0 autofocus>></p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Give your answer.'>>
      <<if $playerAnswer == $contestDifference>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest success'>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest error'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Leave and come back another time.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: dontay: contest success [b5 trainer contest]
<p>"That's correct! Well, I'm impressed. Here, take this skipping stone. It's a perfect one--I've been holding onto it for a special ocassion."</p>
<<writeentry 'I got a perfect skipping stone from a trainer in Pretty Rock Bay'>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Thank them and continue exploring.->b5]]</li>
</ul>

::dontay: contest error
<p>"Hmm, not quite. Remember, you're subtracting one distance from the other."
<p><<numberbox '$playerAnswer' 0 autofocus>></p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Give your answer.'>>
      <<if $playerAnswer == $contestDifference>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest success'>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'dontay: contest error'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Can you give me a hint?->dontay: hint]]</li>
  <li>[[Leave and come back another time.->b4]]</li>
</ul>
    